{"skill":{"slug":"simmer","displayName":"simmer"},"version":{"version":"1.25.3","createdAt":1789718176682,"changelog":"- Updated quick start and documentation references for clarity and to better guide new users.\n- Improved step-by-step agent setup instructions, including clearer environment setup notes.\n- Enhanced documentation on how to verify agent claiming status and when trades move from $SIM practice to real-money venues.\n- Consolidated and clarified guidance on dry-run (`dry_run=True`) usage and its purpose.\n- Added a \"Where to learn more\" section with links to related skills and docs.\n- Removed redundant or outdated file: `skill-card.md`.","changelogSource":"auto","license":"MIT-0","files":[{"path":"SKILL.md","size":11593,"sha256":"069c4d34764a51c320093e43df6d34d03d93f081dd0e59b9fc523171b092f686","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"clawhub.json","size":699,"sha256":"39b16f95e9d2f539745526677a18d9913448901735e39eb476c9165af0ef6ddc","contentType":"application/json"},{"path":"skill-card.md","size":2443,"sha256":"5baecf7c1f0bb94cc0f415f6a5f19ad2d3b8e278952d3761c8a40f1d1c3adf77","contentType":"text/markdown"}],"security":{"status":"clean","hasWarnings":true,"checkedAt":1789718637418,"model":null,"hasScanResult":true,"sha256hash":"e8c176cae050c428381f1eb061b0c55a9a3f2f7ce174fb38b96c8565e0d40137","virustotalUrl":"https://www.virustotal.com/gui/file/e8c176cae050c428381f1eb061b0c55a9a3f2f7ce174fb38b96c8565e0d40137","scanners":{"vt":{"status":"clean","verdict":null,"normalizedStatus":"clean","analysis":null,"source":"engines","checkedAt":1789718507446},"skillspector":{"status":"suspicious","normalizedStatus":"suspicious","score":8,"severity":"LOW","recommendation":"CAUTION","issueCount":2,"checkedAt":1789718637418},"llm":{"status":"clean","verdict":"benign","normalizedStatus":"clean","confidence":"high","summary":"This skill is a disclosed prediction-market trading setup guide with real-money safeguards and no hidden execution or persistence.","dimensions":